cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Reference material homogeneity: CV histograms of metabolite and lipid features"
abstract: >-
  R script plotting the distributions of between-unit and within-unit coefficients
  of variation of metabolite and lipid features (positive and negative ionization
  mode) for vials of a reference material, as a homogeneity assessment of the
  bulk material.
authors:
  - family-names: "Piskláková"
    given-names: "Barbora"
    affiliation: "Section for Metabolomics & Lipidomics, Oslo University Hospital"
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - metabolomics
  - lipidomics
  - reference material
  - homogeneity
  - LC-MS
